<title>USA: Malan Realty Investors Inc Q3 net lower.</title>
<headline>Malan Realty Investors Inc Q3 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Mich. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.06		  $  0.13</p>
<p> Net			    220			437</p>
<p> Revs			 8,868		    8,178</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,460		    3,427</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 8,654		    8,765</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>	 NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.12		   $ 0.46</p>
<p> Net			    427		    1,634</p>
<p> Revs			26,488		   23,350</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,465		    3,543</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 8,659		    8,883</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 funds from operations totaled $1.9 million or $0.54 a share vs $1.8 million or $0.51 a share in 1995 Q3.</p>
<p>1996 nine months funds from operations totaled $5.31 million or $1.53 a share vs $5.29 million or $1.50 a share in 1995 nine months period.</p>
<p>Lower 1996 Q3 net income due primarily to increases in non-cash expenses, including additional depreciation resulting from the company's Clinton Pointe and Fairlane Meadows acquisitions and additional amortization of deferred financing costs related to a financing. These non-cash items have no effect on funds from operations, Malan said.</p>
<p>	   Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
